sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / API Gateway
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>mTLS
    participant HTTP as vLLM HTTP API<br/>8000/TCP
    participant TGIS as vllm_tgis_adapter<br/>gRPC 8033/TCP
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine
    participant GPU as NVIDIA GPU<br/>CUDA Runtime
    participant S3 as Model Storage<br/>S3 / PVC

    Note over Engine,S3: Flow 3: Model Loading at Startup
    Engine->>S3: Load model weights<br/>HTTPS/443 (S3) or filesystem (PVC)<br/>Auth: IAM / SA token
    S3-->>Engine: Model artifacts
    Engine->>GPU: Load model into GPU memory<br/>CUDA runtime

    Note over Client,GPU: Flow 1: HTTP Inference Request
    Client->>Istio: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: OAuth proxy / Bearer
    Istio->>HTTP: Forward request<br/>mTLS enforced
    HTTP->>Engine: Inference request
    Engine->>GPU: CUDA computation
    GPU-->>Engine: Tensor results
    Engine-->>HTTP: Generated text
    HTTP-->>Istio: JSON response
    Istio-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,GPU: Flow 2: gRPC/TGIS Inference Request
    participant KServe as KServe Router /<br/>Model Mesh
    KServe->>Istio: GenerationService RPC<br/>gRPC
    Istio->>TGIS: Forward request<br/>mTLS enforced
    TGIS->>Engine: Inference request
    Engine->>GPU: CUDA computation
    GPU-->>Engine: Tensor results
    Engine-->>TGIS: Generated text
    TGIS-->>Istio: gRPC response
    Istio-->>KServe: Response
